        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Allocate zero-initialized storage from the topology pool. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>On allocation failure, logs the requested size and dumps all available pool usage information.</para><para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>SizeInBytes</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Number of bytes requested.</para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Pointer to the allocated region on success; NULL on failure. </para></simplesect>
</para>        </detaileddescription>
