        <type>void *</type>
        <definition>void* XPm_AllocBytesBoard</definition>
        <argsstring>(u32 SizeInBytes)</argsstring>
        <name>XPm_AllocBytesBoard</name>
        <param>
          <type>u32</type>
          <declname>SizeInBytes</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Allocate zero-initialized storage from the board-data pool. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>On allocation failure, logs the requested size and dumps all available pool usage information.</para><para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
